        <mxCell id="layer1" value="Layer 1 — Architecture &amp; Planning Docs&#xa;&#xa;ARCHITECTURE.md, PLAN-OF-ACTIONS.md, AUDIT.md, USERS.md,&#xa;CURRENT-ARCHITECTURE.md, pre-search.md, diagrams/*&#xa;&#xa;Defines the closed-intent MVP, security gates,&#xa;verification contract, and phased plan." style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#e0f2fe;strokeColor=#0284c7;fontColor=#0f172a;fontSize=13;spacing=12;align=left;" vertex="1" parent="1">
